# 🌱 EcoVision AI

EcoVision AI is an intelligent waste classification platform that uses Machine Learning + FastAPI + Web/Mobile Integration to identify and categorize waste from images.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 🔐 User Authentication (Login / Signup)
- 📸 Image Upload API
- 🧠 AI-based Waste Classification (TensorFlow / Keras)
- 📊 Prediction with Confidence Score
- 👨‍💼 Admin Panel
- 📝 Post & User Management
- 🌐 REST API with FastAPI
- 📱 Mobile + Web Ready Backend

---

## 🧠 ML Model

- Model: wasteClassify.keras
- Framework: TensorFlow + Keras
- Input: Image
- Output: Waste category + confidence

---

## ⚙️ Tech Stack

### Backend:
- FastAPI
- MongoDB
- TensorFlow / Keras
- Uvicorn

### Frontend:
- Next.js / React

### Others:
- JWT Authentication
- File Upload Handling
- REST APIs

---

## 📁 Project Structure

Eco-Vision/ │ ├── backend/ │   ├── app/ │   │   ├── routes/ │   │   ├── models/ │   │   ├── services/ │   │   ├── utils/ │   │   └── main.py │   ├── uploads/ │   └── test_model.py │ ├── frontend/ ├── mobile_app/ └── requirements.txt

---

## ⚡ Setup Instructions

### 1. Clone Repo
git clone https://github.com/vedant-dev27/Eco-Vision.git cd Eco-Vision

### 2. Create Virtual Environment
python3.10 -m venv venv source venv/bin/activate

### 3. Install Dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

### 4. Run Backend
cd backend uvicorn app.main:app --reload

---

## 🌐 API Endpoints

### Health Check
GET /

### Upload Image
POST /upload/image

### Predict Waste
POST /predict

Response:
json {   "prediction": "plastic",   "confidence": 0.92 } 

